/507823984_3549805685172526_2328059039752452002_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ltELHxHeIuEQ7kNvwGw3vt8&_nc_oc=AdrymmT9xrVoqp8kXXF3yHkFVNMC-3aq_pi7Mw3Hmn0rrwYBIHiBfXjRmsA_ajHmMnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9U2ZvpoYbYJMBJvHKg3ADEJz80ZT8nUht5ru6IVEUqFg&oe=6A2C2AB7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5_upscale1440.png", "id": "976267471811597", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_976267475144930_2708776296152154021_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i1zM2Nh3T4cQ7kNvwFq2Z9_&_nc_oc=AdoYaxiAj93SxdFt7o7NJVTYGzF5IQZ-pMbepjLqpKAz1Uy4LK7WGl9DI-mwthad-qE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Pw_s6GpY_hNcFm-oAAfS59Q8QCZ4AzrmhmhSeCVDbcw&oe=6A2C0828"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_6_upscale1440.png", "id": "919354917807890", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_919354924474556_6933787252147107058_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s9bMRfOaOtEQ7kNvwESwYKW&_nc_oc=AdqsY35h5GiSexegzqqVytw0Rg4CowpbZC1qxeddyJAYmuVuwqJHqkgMZ3ADFkfvosk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8vtYpDXrCoc40FdrC-Olh4XqGOk7sEYUAOg8oOGufwPg&oe=6A2C0679"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SuperheroIRL_cover.png", "id": "4201447773456952", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305349_4201447776790285_5717769966148490572_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3lUXvlsptwEQ7kNvwFDJ34U&_nc_oc=AdpnKScQFG6Fni9BrbL9wWEdKlu4M7SIJleGNNvNZRpwszfxIreuJd4E2TilYp0lhYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9sD8aQnvQZ8PNwutMfAaDdgHjuE7tU5nyFOBwawnD1OA&oe=6A2C207F"}, "display_name": "Superhero IRL", "keywords": ["Party", "Superhero", "IRL", "Fighting", "SuperheroIRL"], "long_description": "**Superhero IRL** turns your room into a mixed reality arena.\n\nPunch, slash, thrust, throw, and bash to land powerful hits and counters. Dodge, maneuver, disengage, and chase with real footwork. No complex combos to memorize. Just follow your fighting instincts and unleash the superpowers within.\n\n- **Intuitive Powers**: Punch, slash, throw. Fight with natural body motions. Your body is the controller, so every move feels instantly intuitive, with plenty of tricks to master. Warning: you might accidentally get a workout.\n\n- **Mixed Reality Movement**: Use your actual footwork to close the distance, escape danger, flank your opponent, and take control of the fight. No nausea-inducing joystick sliding. Just stride through your battlefield with momentum.\n\n- **Multiplayer Without Boundaries**: Fight friends in the same room or join online matches where superhero avatars teleport into each other's real-world spaces. Distance cannot stop a brawl.\n\n- **Monster Hunt Challenge**: Play solo or co-op against waves of ferocious monsters. Keep moving, keep fighting, and do not die.\n\n- **Laugh-Out-Loud Action**: Your avatar mirrors your wild moves, from heroic strikes and last-second dodges to body-tracked taunts, silly poses, and victory dances. Every battle can turn into a highlight reel.\n\n**Early Access, Heroic Future**: Launching in Early Access means you can jump in now and help shape the game with your feedback. We are building this together with our players, so suit up and join us on day one!", "short_description": "The battle is raging on your turf.\nPunch, slash, thrust, throw, and bash like a superhero. Dodge, maneuver, disengage, and chase like a hunter. Trust your fighting instincts and unleash the superpowers within. The power is in your body. The arena is in your living room. Pump up your heart rate and stride into battle!\nBe the Hero. In Real Life."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fantapassmr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.fantapassmr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "FantaPass MR Studio Inc.", "support_website_